  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your eyes possess the ability to haunt others.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Nocturne gaze species trait.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Instead of causing a creature to treat all other creatures as though they had concealment, your nocturne gaze instead causes a creature to become shaken. At 11th level, you instead cause a creature to become frightened.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/judow#toc39\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
